 this community  together Rachel helps run it and she's  angry just feel really shocked about if  I'm honest the idea that the government  was doing something it might not have  been the perfect solution but it felt  like something all of a sudden to take  that back  is just galling how is that supposed to  make us trust anybody  you wouldn't accept that in a  relationship why would you accept it  from your government  Cheryl is just one Community struggling  not just with the cost of living but  with the changing and uncertain  political landscape that's impacting on  people's lives here Nick Martin Sky News  Sheffield
 

